{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Animation｜表现流程与来源发布\n[[Animation/结构|接口]] · [[GGYGO_结构_动画与表现.canvas|结构图]] · [[GGYGO_流程_动画曲线处理.canvas|源曲线/CMC子图]] · [[GGYGO_流程_动作姿态修正.canvas|动作姿态子图]]。\n主路径消费语义；旁支发布原配置。姿态沿原生Slot评估，Required票据由Task原生Tick只读检查。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 2590,
      "height": 210,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "source",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "1. CMC / ASC / Pawn更新权威。\n原CMC OnMovementUpdated发布完成Steering区间／资格；GT getter核原来源／新鲜度。\nGetResolvedGait／WalkRunBlendAlpha／Stop／TurnBack及ASC Tag保持；不读Graph决定移动。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 405,
      "width": 385,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "capture",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "2. Base原生命周期\n先处理Owner／来源退休与配置发布，再StateCapture.Capture抓当时语义。\nGT取原Steering快照一次，同帧原alpha入Frame；非Invalid核原身份。\nReset清本人publication、Frame／Debug与派生表现；新Owner不继承旧数据。",
      "x": 470,
      "y": 405,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "read",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "3. ABP读取原Frame／只读查询。\n输入、步态、WalkRun混合、Stop／TurnBack保持；旧拆分引脚由兼容层填充。\n原Steering只供GT方向线性倾身／NA恢复，worker不解析弱对象。",
      "x": 970,
      "y": 405,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "transition",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "4. AnimBP 过渡图选择 EnterMove、Moving、Stop、TurnBack 等状态。\n\nAnimBP 过渡规则消费 StateFrame；C++ 不返回具体 ABP 状态名，EnterMove/Stop/TurnBack 选择留在蓝图。",
      "x": 1470,
      "y": 405,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "play",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "5. ABP选序列 / WalkRun1D\nGetSeqByKey/GetBlendSpaceByKey；EnterMove/Stop/TurnBack单次，Idle/Loop循环。\nWalkRun X=原GaitBlendY alpha，Player／Evaluator／BS轴／网络相位保持。\n普通WalkRun追加单Spine旋转；其他状态Source原路，物理／表现不承诺同clock。",
      "x": 1470,
      "y": 932,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "compat",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "ZZZ原NativeUpdate：Super抓帧→RefreshDecisionContext兼容适配→UpdateWalkRunLeanPresentation。\n旧Adapter／MapMovementState仍只复制alpha→GaitBlendY、Stop→StopValue。\nLifecycle Hook清Memory／Snap／Events和自有倾身来源键，保配置；无移动clock。",
      "x": 970,
      "y": 972,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "future",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 原配置publication\nBase→CMC.PublishLocomotionSourceBinding(binding,error)。\n保存原identity/代次及Status/Error，只冻结引用/metadata。\nMissing/Invalid不授曲线执行；必需时CMC拒绝，Fixed/GA正常。\n配置不变不重发/不每帧刷Error。",
      "x": 470,
      "y": 770,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 400,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo_entry",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## GA/Task启动原播放\nGA BuildSourceBindingRange(Main,End)，新资源关门。\nTask Ready前ConfigureOriginalMontageNotify／登记NotifyReceived与OnFailed→TryPlayMontageWithOwnership。\n原snapshot申请CMC句柄；早期点／非零起点经原NotifySnapshot复核再开放。\n[[Animation/普攻动画实施#作者单点信号配置|配置]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1430,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 350,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo_window",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 原单点→统一打断门\nOnPlayMontageNotifyBegin→Task核原ID／Mesh／Montage→NotifyReceived。\nGA HandleMontageNotify→Scope／Handle就绪→EnableStepInterruption。\n过点合格移动Cancel原句柄；真实新攻击StartStep(Next1/2/0)，新段关门。\nHit／Combo另发事件，不授门。",
      "x": 510,
      "y": 1430,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo_end",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 无受理请求→完整End\nMain.NextSectionName=End，End→停止，无自然Loop。\nHandleMontageSection只记原段落；同一CMC句柄继续轨迹。\n原生末采样间隔开始混出，时长独立读Montage.BlendOut。",
      "x": 1020,
      "y": 1430,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 330,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo_return",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 原动作结束→locomotion\n非中断BlendOut→NotifyMontageActionNaturalBlendOut核原实例。\nCMC末贡献与原Task Completed／有界drain各登记事实；TryCompleteStepMotion等两者→自然End。\n过点合格移动Cancel原资源→GA End，后续攻击从01。\n[[Animation/动作姿态修正|完成链]]",
      "x": 1530,
      "y": 1430,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 400,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "bh3_import",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1900,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 260,
      "text": "## BH3 Kevin DemonBattle：独立导入\n模型/StandBy已保存与预览；75条可导入动画全部成功，4条源空片段未生成。\n独立Skeleton，保留原始根层级；渲染按槽名接线。\n[[Animation/BH3_Kevin_DemonBattle导入|导入说明与验收]]\n[[GGYGO_流程_BH3_DemonBattle导入.canvas|导入流程子图]]",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "kevin_combat",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2300,
      "width": 650,
      "height": 310,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## Kevin战斗动画（资产待生成）\n55独立Montage；Ice01/02候选窗口；Prop1端点与独立ABP。\n已有资产只读核验，缺失才创建；Movement提供InPlace并执行位移。\n完整链接与3项Animation安全自动化通过；生产资产及玩法待验收。\n[[Animation/资产生产安全|保护契约]] · [[Animation/Kevin战斗动画实施|实施]] · [[GGYGO_流程_Kevin战斗动画.canvas|生成流程]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "source_resolve",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 原source配置解析\nNativeInitialize/Update发现实际变化→ZZZ.ResolveLocomotionSourceBinding。\n五单段routes＋实际walkRun BS样本；验证refs/rates/length。\n新配置代次单调跨reinit，旧source不授权新Owner。\n源曲线求值归CMC。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 770,
      "width": 385,
      "height": 400,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "source_retire",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Uninitialize / Owner或配置退出\nBase→RetireLocomotionSourceBinding仅撤原producer／代次。\nHook清本人Frame／表现；ResetWalkRunLeanPresentation清Angle／Valid／Failure／弱CMC／Epoch，不清后继资源。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1220,
      "width": 890,
      "height": 160,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "action_pose_evaluate",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 同次原生AnimGraph评估\nGT Guard核实际输入并发布native counter／能力。\nSuper Slot Evaluate唯一混合，hook只借同次参与Source XYZ向量。\nQ(native)扣Source／参考贡献加原组件对齐，只改Body local translation。\n原空间转换／Inertialization输出，借用不跨Evaluate。\n[[GGYGO_流程_动作姿态修正.canvas|公式与失败]]",
      "x": 2050,
      "y": 405,
      "width": 540,
      "height": 470,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "action_pose_required",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Required依赖存续与失败\nTask原生TickTask→PollActionPoseContract(原ticket)，不积dt。\nValid→继续原Task；Failed/Invalidated→FailActionPoseContract。\n精确原Stop/scale归还/EndTask后历史OnFailed→GA核原Activation/step/Task/资源→RequestAbilityEnd。\n清自身CMC句柄；CanBeCanceled=false也不阻止依赖失败End。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构|Task/GA清理]] · [[Animation/动作姿态修正|能力契约]]",
      "x": 2050,
      "y": 1000,
      "width": 540,
      "height": 480,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "action_pose_capsule",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 胶囊与最终姿态分开验\n原BeginMontageActionMotion→同一RMS／CMC时钟按Main→End原PosXYZ执行。\n最后贡献经ApplyRootMotionToVelocity／AfterMovement→PublishMontageActionMotionCompletion一次。\nBody XYZ只属Mesh，None／SlotWeight不定义动作完成，不回写速度／输入。\n[[Movement/动作曲线执行|CMC接口]] · [[Animation/动作姿态修正|姿态边界]]",
      "x": 2050,
      "y": 1600,
      "width": 540,
      "height": 400,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "steering_read",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## GT Capture原区间\nGetLocomotionSteeringSnapshot一次→现有Frame。\n原三弱身份／Epoch／完成Serial、Frame、native dt与Status；资格／新鲜度归CMC。\nDesiredDirectionError为原Actor→准入方向[-180,180]°、正右；同帧alpha保持。\n无Character不捕获，缺provider／原身份不符明确Invalid；worker不解析弱对象。",
      "x": 970,
      "y": 2150,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 400,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "walkrun_lean_update",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UZZZ原NativeUpdate倾身\nSuper抓帧／旧适配后→UpdateWalkRunLeanPresentation。\nValid：angle=原DesiredDirectionError/FullAngle × lerp(WalkMax,RunMax,同帧alpha)。\n直接赋值；偏差减半→角减半，零偏差→零／Valid=true；无角速度门／饱和／Enter滤波。\n参考角≥180°；本角色180°、Walk2°／Run6°、仅NA Recovery8。\n输出正右Angle／Valid／Failure；非法配置／值明确失败，原弱来源／Epoch切换先Reset。\n[[Animation/计划_动画与表现层#身体线性侧倾（2026-10-09）|当前契约与有限验收]]",
      "x": 1470,
      "y": 2150,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 450,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "walkrun_spine_pose",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 普通Moving→WalkRun姿态\n原BS Player→L2C→stock ModifyBone(Bip001-Spine)→C2L→原Result。\nAngle→MakeRotator.Pitch（Yaw／Roll0）→Rotation；Valid→SelectFloat true1／false0→Alpha。\nRotation Additive／ComponentSpace，Translation／Scale Ignore；无蓝图第二滤波。\n正Pitch向ActorRight倾；原GaitBlendY／BS轴／主图／另24图保持，不改Body／Root。",
      "x": 2050,
      "y": 2150,
      "width": 540,
      "height": 420,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "walkrun_lean_release",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 自有恢复／失效出口\n仅NotApplicable→RecoverWalkRunLeanPresentation：自身角×exp(-Recovery×原AnimDt)，RunMax界内恢复，近零清Valid；dt有限非负。\nInitial合法等待清姿态／Valid，不伪造有效零偏差。Invalid／非法Enabled配置或值立即清角／Valid、保定位Failure并去重。\n原弱CMC／Epoch变化、Lifecycle Hook→Reset清本人角／Valid／Failure／来源键，保AnimSet／Tuning；不重判移动或清GA资源。",
      "x": 1470,
      "y": 2680,
      "width": 1120,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "3"
    }
  ],
